    93	## Phase 4 — WebSocket transport (`src/cljc/dao/stream/ws.cljc`)
    94	
    95	Per `dao.stream.ws.md`, both ends:
    96	
    97	- **Serving side**: a host composition that serves a ring buffer over a
    98	  WebSocket endpoint — descriptor carries host, port, and the served
